/*!
\page page_strichmcinfo StRichMCInfo

\brief \ref page_strichmcinfo "StRichMCInfo" — generator-level truth record for a RICH MC pixel or hit.

\section strichmcinfo_overview Overview
StRichMCInfo is the lowest-level Monte Carlo truth object in the RICH data
model. It records the simulator and GEANT particle identifiers, the parent MC
track index, the particle charge, and the GEANT process code that produced the
hit. It is embedded in \ref page_strichmcpixel "StRichMCPixel" (by pointer,
multiple per pixel) and \ref page_strichmchit "StRichMCHit" (by value).

\section strichmcinfo_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StRichMCInfo
\endcode

\section strichmcinfo_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Int_t | mId | Simulator particle identifier |
| Int_t | mGid | GEANT particle identifier (8=π⁺, 11=K⁺, 14=proton) |
| Int_t | mTrackp | Parent MC track index |
| Float_t | mCharge | Electric charge (units of e) |
| Int_t | mProcess | GEANT process code (e.g. 0=Cherenkov) |

\section strichmcinfo_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| int id() const | Simulator particle identifier |
| int gid() const | GEANT particle identifier |
| int trackp() const | Parent MC track index |
| float charge() const | Particle electric charge |
| int process() const | GEANT process code |

\section strichmcinfo_related Related Classes
\ref page_strichmcpixel "StRichMCPixel" — pixel that owns a collection of these records. \n
\ref page_strichmchit "StRichMCHit" — reconstructed hit that embeds one of these records.
*/
